    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "26_g6_laterano_chapelin",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$warm_intro",
        "key": "$warm_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell me more!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, be careful with the candle! Don't get burnt!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosella"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#10$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah! Can't mess up the shape... It won't look pretty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "I need to... make it look nicer... for Mamma.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#10$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, I've told you a lot already. It's all boring adventures and the same old day-to-day life. As for Kazdel in the legends...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosella"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's kind of embarrassing to say, but none of us have ever been.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosella"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#10$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Kazdel is to the Sarkaz... like what Laterano is to the Sankta, right? It's the Sarkaz homeland...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone's gotta be very happy. There are cotton candy food trucks, right? And candy stores, too... There are lots of happy Sarkaz on the streets, all of them saying hi to each other!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosella"
    },
    {
        "text": "It could be like that, one day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosella"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why don't we talk about you instead, Cecelia? What are your papa and mama like?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosella"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I don't actually know...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#10$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I haven't seen Pap\u00e0 that many times... Every time we went to see him, Mamma did a lot of work to prepare, and we always left at night... We walked very far... to the forest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#11$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We met him in the forest, and he wore a big cape, like he hurried to us from somewhere far away...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#11$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't actually remember what he looks like very well, but I remember his horns! They're black and straight, and they twinkle bright under the moonlight!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#11$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "He took me by my hand and walked around the forest. He told me the names of the trees and how old they were... It gets very quiet at night outside the city. You don't even hear fowlbeasts. But I was never scared.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#11$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "He grabbed my hand so tight. It kinda hurt... but I didn't say anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#10$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Every time we saw each other, he looked like he was even happier than I was! And he also looked... a little nervous?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "When I got tired, Mamma would carry me on her back and take me home. When I looked back, Pap\u00e0 would be there under the big tree. He kept looking at us. Even after we got very far away, he would still stand there...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Your mama and papa are both wonderful people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosella"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mamma's amazing! She knows how to do everything!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#10$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Look. This is Mamma's guardian gun! Ezell gave it to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mamma said that Pap\u00e0 couldn't beat her in a fight if he tried... She always let Pap\u00e0 win! But I know Pap\u00e0's really amazing, too!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#10$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha, Cecelia. When I say 'wonderful,' it probably doesn't mean the same thing as what you mean by 'amazing.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosella"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Really? I'm sure Pap\u00e0 and Mamma are both wonderful and amazing!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mamma never told me how she met Pap\u00e0, though. Every time I asked her, she would start talking about something else... Why didn't she want to tell me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "When you're still a kid, there are a lot of other, more important things. Do you like watching tea brew? When I was your age, I loved looking at brewing tea. The water would get darker and darker by the second...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosella"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Rosella... The way you're talking about something else now is just like Mamma...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I may look like I don't know a lot, but actually... I know a little.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I ran all around the city yesterday, but I didn't see any Sarkaz besides you... Sarkaz aren't supposed to come to Laterano, are they?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#12$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's why Pap\u00e0 and Mamma shouldn't be together... No, I mean, there is somebody who doesn't want him to be with Mamma, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#12$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No, there's no such thing as two people who shouldn't be together... All this will change. And it won't be too long from now... It will happen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosella"
    },
    {
        "text": "Love isn't a crime.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosella"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's why we are here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosella"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And when that day comes, can I walk around Laterano all I want?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosella"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#12$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I won't have to hide in my room anymore? I can visit all the candy stores in Laterano one at a time?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#12$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Just once? You can go as many times as you want.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosella"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#10$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Wow... I want that day to come soon... I wanna grow up soon!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#10$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Right, maybe if you grow up soon, it'll just...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosella"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, Cecelia, there's no hurry. When I was your age, I also thought that growing up would solve everything, but when I finally grew up...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosella"
    },
    {
        "text": "Growing up is very, very, very tough, Cecelia, and it will be even harder for you. The burden that you'll carry on your shoulders... No, never mind. You're still a kid. Let's not think about that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosella"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#12$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though everyone grows up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#12$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Right... We don't have a choice but to grow up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosella"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$storyendjp_intro",
        "key": "$storyendjp_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "Rosella, who has been smiling the whole time, suddenly seems somewhat lonely, all of a sudden."
    },
    {
        "text": "She looks out the chapel's window at the graveyard outside. It's full of blooming flowers, and in the distance, the tall statue in the center of Lateran City makes a faint impression."
    },
    {
        "text": "She starts humming a song, sorrowful but with a hint of hope."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, that song! You hummed it yesterday too...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "When Mamma taught me that song, she said she didn't know the words anymore, so she always just sang it with lalalas, but I really like how it sounds... What is the song actually about?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This is a Sarkaz song. It's about a hero who's about to go on a journey to do something really amazing, and that's why everyone sang this song to say their goodbyes and send him on his way, hoping he'll come back safely.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosella"
    },
    {
        "text": "The hero of the song is going somewhere far away to fulfill his dreams...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosella"
    },
    {
        "text": "It may be a long, long journey, but he will surely, certainly...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosella"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$dooropenquite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mister Ezell! Mister Friar!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you chatting about?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good day, Guide\u2014Nothing important. Just old stories about the Sarkaz and a few trivial topics.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosella"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm having fun... I've never talked to someone so long.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mister Ezell, did you pick these flowers?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, I thought... we could extract the flower's fragrance and give the candles a little scent.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fragrance can help guide the departed in the right direction.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's so nice! Thanks, Mister Ezell!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um... Actually... I'm... I'm a little scared.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "When I say goodbye to Mamma at the funeral... That's going to be the last goodbye, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Does that really mean I can't see her anymore? Not even on holidays? Not even once in a long while, like Pap\u00e0? Even... if I just want her to pat my head?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even... Even if...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's still a story about an angel and a burdenbeast... that she hasn't finished telling me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cecelia...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tonight's the last time, Cecelia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll stay with you in your mama's room tonight, okay? All of us will be there. You won't be alone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosella"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "A Sarkaz watching over a Sankta child and her mother...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The candlelight may be feeble, but it too can light up the path to the other side.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
