    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_213_mostma_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lemuen, we're here to see you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We brought you some dessert.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_213_mostma_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "A fruit tart I swiped from the Basilica.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_353_1#10$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Welcome. By the way, that cactus looks disgusting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_213_mostma_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's our girl, Lemuen. You've got fine eyes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_353_1#10$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you two really miss me so much that you have to visit every day?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_213_mostma_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We could come see you every hour, if that's what you want.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_353_1#10$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Trying to curry favor, are you, Mostima? And you, Fiammetta... That's a terrible smile if I've ever seen one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_353_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did something happen?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's Andoain...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_353_1#8$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_353_1#6$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "You ran into him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We encountered a Sarkaz who had infiltrated Laterano, and when I was chasing her... I saw his Originium Arts firsthand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_353_1#9$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I see. It's good that you aren't hurt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lemuen, are you sure you're okay here? This is a normal hospital. If he...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_353_1#8$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's paid me a visit already.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What did you just\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_213_mostma_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "A silence descends upon the room."
    },
    {
        "text": "Lemuen looks at the flowers on the table."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The way you two talk about him is like... you're talking about a picnic you had over the weekend.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lemuen, I'm not mad about you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, whenever we talk about him, you... and Mostima too. Each and every time, whenever I bring it up, you two always have that same look.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whenever I see that expression on your faces, it makes me think... maybe it wasn't him who went crazy that day. That I lost my mind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_213_mostma_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We felt it, is all...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your Sankta hive mind again? Fine, you felt what he felt. Why did you point your gun at him, then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_213_mostma_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That has nothing to do with this. It didn't matter how... out of it he was, I couldn't let him take the Lock and Key.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about after that? You fell because of him! Does that not bother you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lemuen, it was his Arts that put you in this hospital. You fell into a coma for five whole years... does that not bother you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_353_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fiammetta...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_353_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Trust me, I'm on your side.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_353_1#9$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's just that I could really feel...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't want to hear that word anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you think I'm mad about all this for no good reason?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_353_1#6$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course not, I understand...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right, of course. All of you understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm the only one who doesn't.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
