        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm done with you stinking Sankta already! Your empathy? The way you understand each other? I don't want to hear any of it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did those halos fry your angel brains? You and Lemuen almost died in those ruins!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why aren't you angry? Why aren't you mad? Why am I the only one... the only one who's mad?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't give me that arrogant smile and that 'nothing matters' attitude! You had to leave Laterano and drift all across the world, bum out in the boonies. Whose fault do you think that was?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "text": "I followed you all the way to Victoria, to Leithanien, Sargon, Yan...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you think that was for?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "text": "You, Lemuen, Andoain... our team. There was a time... when we trusted each other.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "text": "What kind of God Almighty reason does he have anyway? What gave him the right to betray our trust? And what gave you two the right to understand him? Why should I have to understand him?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you know how much I miss those days? All those times we finished a mission after all those close calls... all those times Lemuen took us out to drinks... all those times we tried out a new dessert shop...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even those times he fixed our reports...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "text": "What gave him the right to ruin it all?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those days...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those days... mean a lot to me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
